{"id":"n9a50bfbym43","viewport":{"x":132.25132199970244,"y":140.36178761678934,"z":0.5897833576128505,"fitted":true},"items":[{"id":"lwoma18zym43","type":"note","x":0,"y":0,"w":320,"h":330,"color":"blue","pinned":true,"created":1792664169843,"updated":1792664311317,"title":"How stickers work","html":"<h2>Each sticker is a small editor</h2><p>Type <code>#</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>[]</code> or <code>&gt;</code> then a space for headings, lists, checklists and quotes.</p><ul class=\"checks\"><li data-done=\"false\">Double-click the board to add a sticker</li><li data-done=\"false\">Drop or paste an image to pin a photo</li><li data-done=\"false\">Press <b>Shift</b> twice to search everything</li><li data-done=\"false\">Pin a sticker to keep it in place</li></ul>"},{"id":"rtwdwga1ym43","type":"note","x":372,"y":5,"w":280,"h":230,"color":"amber","pinned":false,"created":1792664169843,"updated":1792664169843,"title":"Things to remember","html":"<ul><li>Wi-Fi at the office: <code>guest-5G</code></li><li>Renew passport before <b>March</b></li><li>Mom's birthday — 14 June</li></ul><blockquote>Example sticker. Edit or delete it.</blockquote>"},{"id":"sal40j53ym7k","type":"photo","src":"4319037b8068d88a3b4c.png","ar":1.3235294117647058,"x":687,"y":0,"w":280,"rot":3,"caption":"sunset, example photo","created":1792664169843,"updated":1792664169843},{"id":"8e8dtq30ym7k","type":"arrow","a":{"id":"lwoma18zym43"},"b":{"id":"rtwdwga1ym43"},"stroke":"#9DA0A8","width":2,"rough":true,"seed":209335786},{"id":"zfaip7coym7k","type":"rect","x":-24,"y":380,"w":690,"h":120,"stroke":"#5FB865","width":2,"fill":"hachure","rough":true,"seed":109628910},{"id":"9b4meop4ym7k","type":"note","x":3,"y":395,"w":640,"h":104,"color":"green","pinned":false,"created":1792664169843,"updated":1792664169843,"title":"Sketch around your stickers","html":"<p>Use the pen, arrows and boxes from the toolbar. Double-click a tool to keep it active.</p>"},{"id":"148n64gy0how","type":"photo","src":"52acf664f7ca8040